From 98951853c25bed25d7c6198ef0ec1012bf2e4be3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 00:07:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3200/3799] soh: rename D_8082A070 -> sCursorColorSets

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the four RGBA sets the quest cursor cycles between
Defined in soh/src/overlays/misc/ovl_kaleido_scope/z_kaleido_collect.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../ovl_kaleido_scope/z_kaleido_collect.c     | 28 +++++++++----------
 1 file changed, 14 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/misc/ovl_kaleido_scope/z_kaleido_collect.c b/soh/src/overlays/misc/ovl_kaleido_scope/z_kaleido_collect.c
index 16d7609fa..08a5681e1 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/misc/ovl_kaleido_scope/z_kaleido_collect.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/misc/ovl_kaleido_scope/z_kaleido_collect.c
